category: Libs
requires: cygwin libfftw3-omp3 libfftw3_3 libgomp1
sdesc: "Library for nonequispaced discrete Fourier transform (runtime)"
ldesc: "The NFFT is a C subroutine library for computing the nonequispaced discrete
Fourier transform (NDFT) in one or more dimensions, of arbitrary input size,
and of complex data."
external-source: nfft

